OL,3,GNEWSAMan catches thief with Apple
OL,4,AAirTag hidden in stone
OL,5,
OL,6,FA thief who was stealing a wall piece
OL,7,Fby piece was caught when a man put a
OL,8,Ftracking device in one of the stones.
OL,10,FMatt Smith said people living near
OL,11,FRufford Old Hall in Lancashire, "were
OL,12,Fgetting a bit miffed" with stones being
OL,13,Ftaken from the 300-year-old boundary
OL,14,Fwall.
OL,16,FSo he put an Apple AirTag - a
OL,17,Fcoin-sized tracking device people
OL,18,Fattach to keys or wallets in case they
OL,19,Flose them - inside one of the stones.
OL,23,APub: 05-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
