OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice followed the trail to an address
OL,7,Fin Wigan, and earlier this month, a man
OL,8,Fpleaded guilty at Wigan Magistrates'
OL,9,FCourt to two counts of theft and one
OL,10,Fcount of handling stolen goods.
